{{!-- Same as Tauri's built-in desktop-file template (freedesktop/main.desktop)
except Exec carries %u. Without it, activating the ayahlab:// scheme (e.g. the
OAuth deep-link callback) launches this app with no arguments — the desktop
environment has nowhere to put the URL — so the callback is silently dropped
and sign-in never completes. See DebConfig/RpmConfig's `desktopTemplate`. --}}
[Desktop Entry]
Categories={{categories}}
{{#if comment}}
Comment={{comment}}
{{/if}}
Exec={{exec}} %u
StartupWMClass={{exec}}
Icon={{icon}}
Name={{name}}
Terminal=false
Type=Application
{{#if mime_type}}
MimeType={{mime_type}}
{{/if}}
